# Minimal torrc for a system Tor that tor_ip_swapper.py can attach to.
# Put this in your Tor config directory (e.g. /etc/tor/torrc on Linux,
# %APPDATA%\tor\torrc on Windows) and restart tor.

SocksPort 9050
ControlPort 9051

# Pick ONE authentication method:

# 1) Cookie auth (easiest, the script auto-detects the cookie path)
CookieAuthentication 1

# 2) Password auth (then run the script with --control-password SECRET)
#HashedControlPassword 16:...
